{"name":"Brushwood","hex":"#8c5939","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"brushwood","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Branches and twigs fallen from trees and shrubs.","Small trees and shrubs."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brushwood"}],"entries":[{"title":"Brian Brushwood","blocks":[{"text":"Brian Allen Brushwood is an American magician, podcaster, author, lecturer, YouTuber and comedian. Brushwood is known for the series Scam Nation, a show where he teaches the audience entertaining tricks at bars so they can \"scam\" a free drink. The show also claims to be the only show dedicated to social engineering at the bar and on the street. In addition to Scam Nation, Brushwood co-hosts the podcasts Weird Things with Andrew Mayne and Justin Robert Young, Cordkillers with Tom Merritt, and Great Night with Young. Brushwood was also a regular guest on the This Week in Tech podcast. Brushwood performs his Bizarre Magic stage show across the United States and is the author of six books. Brushwood also co-hosted a YouTube show along with Jason Murphy called The Modern Rogue. Brushwood has appeared on national television numerous times including on The Tonight Show with Jay Leno, CNN and Food Network."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Brian_Brushwood_at_CSICon_2026_%28Vert%29.jpg/330px-Brian_Brushwood_at_CSICon_2026_%28Vert%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brian_Brushwood"},{"title":"Brushwood, New South Wales","blocks":[{"text":"Brushwood is a rural community in the central east part of the Riverina region of New South Wales, Australia. It is situated by road about 6 kilometres (3.7 mi) east of Ganmain and 8 kilometres (5.0 mi) west of Coolamon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/BrushwoodSilos.jpg/330px-BrushwoodSilos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brushwood%2C_New_South_Wales"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Brian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon%2ACon_2011.jpg/500px-Brian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon%2ACon_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Brian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon%2ACon_2011.jpg/1280px-Brian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon%2ACon_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Brian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon%2ACon_2011.jpg/500px-Brian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon%2ACon_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Brian \"Shwood\" Brushwood and Evan Bernstein during a live recording of The Geologic Podcast at Dragon*Con 2011 in Atlanta, GA","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABrian_Brushwood_and_Evan_Bernstein_at_Dragon*Con_2011.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Veronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg/500px-Veronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Veronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg/1280px-Veronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Veronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg/500px-Veronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Veronica Belmont and Brushwood preparing for the Game On! internet show November 13, 2011","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVeronica_Belmont_and_Brian_Brushwood.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb